---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="What Engrebodds collects (very little), why, and your rights." noindex>
  <div class="stack prose" style="max-width:72ch">
    <div>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="draft"><strong>Draft, needs legal review.</strong> This must be checked by a lawyer against the UK GDPR and Nigeria's Data Protection Act 2023 before launch, and again before accounts open.</p>
    </div>
    <section>
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Engrebodds is operated from the United Kingdom. [Legal name, address and contact to be added.]</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>When you visit</h2>
      <p>Visiting the site collects nothing that identifies you: no advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
      <ul class="prose-list">
        <li><strong>Hosting logs.</strong> Our host, Cloudflare, processes your IP address and browser details to deliver pages and protect the site from abuse.</li>
        <li><strong>Visit statistics.</strong> We plan to use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which counts visits without cookies and without identifying you.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Where data is stored</h2>
      <p>Our football data and tips are stored with Supabase in London. Cloudflare serves the site from data centres worldwide.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>If you create an account</h2>
      <p>Accounts open with Premium (planned for August 2027). If you create one, we keep:</p>
      <ul class="prose-list">
        <li><strong>Your email address,</strong> to send your sign-in codes and run your account. We don't send marketing.</li>
        <li><strong>That you confirmed you are 18 or older,</strong> and when.</li>
        <li><strong>Your payments:</strong> plan, amount, date, payment method type (card, transfer or USSD) and status. Card details go only to Paystack, our payment provider; we never see or store them.</li>
        <li><strong>A sign-in cookie,</strong> needed to keep you signed in. It isn't used for tracking.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Processors: Supabase (accounts and data, London), Paystack (payments), Cloudflare (hosting, and Turnstile, which checks sign-in requests come from a person) and our email provider for sign-in codes.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Deleting your account and how long we keep data</h2>
      <p>You can delete your account at any time from your account page. That removes your email address, sign-in and age confirmation straight away. Payment records are kept for 6 years after the payment, without your name, because accounting and tax rules require it. [Retention period to be confirmed by the lawyer or accountant.]</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under the UK GDPR and the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 you can ask what data we hold about you, have it corrected or deleted, and complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office or the Nigeria Data Protection Commission. [Contact route to be added.]</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
